{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53998","headline":"十二时歌 三 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日出卯，清净却翻爲烦恼。\n有爲功德被尘谩（《偈颂》作「幔」），无限田地未曾扫。\n攒眉多，称心少，尀耐东村黑黄老。\n供利不曾将得来，放驴吃我堂前草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53998.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53998","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}